@startuml
title Resale Listing Sequence - Flow 2a
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Seller
participant "ResaleSalePage" as WebApp
participant "API Gateway" as ApiGw
participant "Marketplace Service" as MktSvc
database "marketplace_listings\n(metadata only)" as MktDb
participant "Contract Sync\nRPC Listener" as CSync
database "token_ownerships" as CSyncDb
participant "SDK Client\nbuildMarketplaceListTx()" as SdkClient
participant "Handler" as Handler
participant "TicketLedger" as Ledger
participant "MarketplaceV2" as MktV2

== Load vé có thể bán lại ==

Seller -> WebApp : Mở trang Đăng Bán
WebApp -> ApiGw : GET /v1/tokens?ownerWalletAddress=...
ApiGw -> CSync : proxy
CSync -> CSyncDb : WHERE owner=seller\nAND listing_status='none'\nAND is_used=false
CSyncDb --> WebApp : danh sách vé

== Tạo listing metadata record ==

Seller -> WebApp : Chọn vé + đặt giá → bấm "Đăng Bán"

WebApp -> ApiGw : POST /v1/marketplace/listings\n{ tokenId, eventId, askPrice,\n  sellerWalletAddress }\nheader: x-kyc-status: approved

ApiGw -> MktSvc : validate KYC\nvalidate markup ≤ maxMarkupBps\ncheck không trùng token_id

MktSvc -> MktDb : INSERT marketplace_listings\n{ id, token_id, event_id,\n  seller_user_id, ask_price,\n  original_price, currency }

note right of MktDb
  Không có cột status.
  Không có on_chain_listing_id.
  Chỉ là metadata off-chain.
end note

MktSvc --> WebApp : { listingId: "lst_..." }

== Build & ký EIP-7702 batch tx ==

WebApp -> SdkClient : buildMarketplaceListTx(\n  ticketLedgerAddress,\n  marketplaceAddress,\n  tokenId, askPrice,\n  chainId, nonce\n)
SdkClient --> WebApp : authorizationTuple\n+ executeBatchCalldata

WebApp -> WebApp : signAuthorization() → signedAuth\nassembleTx4()

== Broadcast lên chain ==

WebApp -> Handler : broadcast EIP-7702 type-4 tx
Handler -> Ledger : transferTicket(tokenId, marketplace)
Ledger --> Handler : owner = marketplace ✓
Handler -> MktV2 : listTicket(tokenId, askPrice)
MktV2 -> MktV2 : listingId = ++listingCounter [= N]
MktV2 --> Handler : emit TicketListed(listingId=N,\n  seller, tokenId, price)
Handler --> WebApp : txHash ✓

WebApp --> Seller : "Đăng bán thành công ✓"

== Contract-sync tự cập nhật (độc lập, async) ==

MktV2 ->> CSync : TicketListed event\n(RPC WebSocket subscription)
CSync -> CSync : mapTicketListed()\n→ ListingStatusChanged\n  { tokenId, listingId=N,\n    status=active }
CSync -> CSyncDb : UPSERT token_ownerships\nlisting_status = 'active'\nsource_listing_id = 'N'

note right of CSync
  Hoàn toàn độc lập.
  Marketplace-service không cần
  biết, không cần gọi,
  không cần push gì cả.
end note

@enduml
